---
import NsMonogram from './NsMonogram.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="about-sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h2 class="sec-title" data-decode>How do I know it works?</h2>
      <p class="sec-sub">The first question I ask of anything I build, and the one this whole portfolio tries to answer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid reveal">
      <div class="about-portrait" aria-hidden="true">
        <NsMonogram />
        <span class="ap-meta">NS · identity</span>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy" data-stagger>
        <p>I'm <b>Nico</b>, a <b>Fullstack Developer</b> at bekumoo Software GmbH in Osnabrück. I work on the company's analytics platform (Python and FastAPI in the backend, React and TypeScript in the frontend), on its own LLM-based chatbot, and I built and run an internal company platform on Azure, with infrastructure as code in Pulumi, CI/CD and SSO.</p>
        <p>I joined bekumoo in 2023 as a dual-study student and started with Power BI and Azure Synapse reporting. Through my first university projects (for example the <a href="https://github.com/g-dev-net/HSOS-Programmierprojekt" rel="noopener noreferrer">programming team project</a>) I grew into data engineering and then into backend and frontend development. I finished my Bachelor in Wirtschaftsinformatik at Hochschule Osnabrück in 2026 and have been working as a developer since July.</p>
        <p>I work with <b>Claude Code</b> every day, with my own setup of skills, agents, rules and context engineering. The point is quality: tests, reviews and understanding the code that ships, not vibe coding.</p>
        <p>In my spare time I build data science and ML projects, LLM tools and agents, small games and mobile apps. They are on this site because they measure themselves: <b>how do I know it works?</b> is the first question I ask any system, and the one this portfolio tries to answer.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-sec {
    padding: 14vh 0;
  }

  .sec-sub {
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 15px;
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 50px;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
    }
  }

  .about-copy p {
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  /* paragraphs cascade in as they scroll into view — CSS only, visible without JS */
  @supports (animation-timeline: view()) {
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .about-copy p {
        animation: pIn 1ms linear both;
        animation-timeline: view();
        animation-range: entry 5% entry 45%;
      }
    }
  }
  @keyframes pIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: none; } }

  .about-copy a {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .about-copy b {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-portrait {
    position: sticky;
    top: 110px;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    max-width: 240px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 120% at 30% 20%, rgba(var(--accent-rgb), 0.10), transparent 60%),
      var(--surface);
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
  }

  /* scanline overlay */
  .about-portrait::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.5;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      0deg,
      transparent 0 2px,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05) 3px
    );
  }

  /* constrain the NsMonogram SVG inside the portrait box */
  .about-portrait :global(svg) {
    width: 60%;
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
    animation: breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes breathe {
    50% { transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.02); }
  }

  .ap-meta {
    position: absolute;
    left: 12px;
    bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .about-portrait :global(svg) { animation: none; }
  }
</style>
